{"backendEventChannel":"assistant","backendEventContent":"{\n  \"when\": {\"always\": true},\n  \"payload\": {\n    \"revision\": 20,\n    \"guidelinePath\": \"docs\/table-count-guideline.md\",\n    \"guidelineSha256\": \"a594e5fc6b947820e00bd3152fa149b25b709a54f5217cb02f70e799582a0a94\",\n    \"completionStatus\": \"incomplete_source_repair_required_after_owned_interruption\",\n    \"fullStateArtifact\": {\n      \"path\": \"results\/reviews\/integrate-revision20-output.json\",\n      \"sha256\": \"c5ce3cbdb6577354bf9900a44035033ef6f62d28c55f936f1fe90978e0e985e3\",\n      \"contents\": \"workflowInput原文、全42指摘・著者回答、全77要求、全12議論履歴、各要求の元定義と過去revision状態を保持。以下の回答一覧はその要約。\",\n      \"priorStatePath\": \"results\/reviews\/integrate-revision19-output.json\"\n    },\n    \"workflowInput\": {\n      \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n        \"GPT-6.1 Solのみを使用し、執筆と2つの査読を別の役割・セッションで実施する。未解決high\/middleは0とし、異種モデルの独立性は主張しない。ラウンド上限を合格にしない。\",\n        \"未知の任意表で数%精度や本番無影響を無条件に保証しない。参考統計・条件付き確率推定・正確COUNTを区別し、精度と予算と後始末を別判定する\",\n        \"暗号化され内容不明の50〜100列表に具体的な経路と根拠を示す。TDEと列暗号化を区別する\",\n        \"cache\/index\/暗号化\/条件漏れ\/検証不備の査読を含め、主要結論ごとに根拠の適用範囲を確認する\",\n        \"本文数値はハッシュ付きの保持されたresults\/reference配下へ対応。実験完了・精度達成・SLO合格を区別する\",\n        \"固定runnerが白紙DBからのmise run allを実施し、文書反映後に所有者が結果の意味と最終計測ソースの不変性を監査する。reproductionProofPathが無い間は完了としない\",\n        \"Latest user accepts about10% when few-percent is costly: compare3\/5\/10% accuracy-cost frontiers and exactCOUNT, show how conditions improve or worsen accuracy, and recommend methods under explicit error\/freshness\/service budgets.\"\n      ],\n      \"accuracyFrontierExistingEvidencePath\": \"results\/reviews\/accuracy-frontier-existing-evidence.json\",\n      \"additionalExperimentRequired\": {\n        \"budget\": \"必要なら仮説を変えず複数scriptへ分割。timeout\/guardの部分結果を完走としない。追加・変更したコードのセルフチェックも更新する。\",\n        \"coverage\": \"少なくとも100列TDEについて、小さい索引があればexact COUNTが勝つ条件と、索引なしでbounded samplingが負荷\/読取量を減らせるか、索引更新で何が変わるかを確認する。service負荷なしの精度\/コスト比較とservice負荷中の診断を区別する。\",\n        \"currentImplementation\": \"01a\/01b completed successfully;24-file immutable source\/results snapshot is at wideSamplingSnapshotPath. Remaining original0h-0l run serially under current owner. Latest accuracy-cost01c\/01d are already prepared and root-fixed for review001\/002; see latestAccuracySteering and assessment. Do not duplicate.\",\n        \"implementation\": \"01a\/01b completed successfully;24-file immutable source\/results snapshot is at wideSamplingSnapshotPath. Remaining original0h-0l run serially under current owner. Latest accuracy-cost01c\/01d are already prepared and root-fixed for review001\/002; see latestAccuracySteering and assessment. Do not duplicate.\",\n        \"protocol\": \"順序交替、対照、warmup\/回復の明示、actual method区間と広いtrialの区別、予定数保存則・unfinished\/censoredを保存。固定乱数は再現用であり本番信頼度の根拠ではない。ホストcacheは未制御。短窓からSLO合格や無影響を認定しない。\",\n        \"purpose\": \"確率的推定を50\/100列表という実対象へ対応させる。同じコードで整数PK・TDE・小さい索引有無・indexed\/nonindexed UPDATEを比較し、精度とコストと負荷を別判定する。\"\n      },\n      \"capacityMaintenanceEvidencePath\": \"results\/reviews\/build-cache-cleanup-evidence.json\",\n      \"completionAuditPath\": \"results\/reviews\/pre-final-audit.json\",\n      \"constraints\": [\n        \"実データベース接続禁止。Composeのprimary\/replicaとLabが起動するmatrixサーバーだけ\",\n        \"table dataをコミットしない。測定JSONを捏造・書換えしない\",\n        \"人が読む主文書は日本語・220行以内。詳細は分離したまま維持\",\n        \"commit\/pushはワークフローから実施しない\",\n        \"測定と別の実験を重ねない。固定runnerと.lab.lockを使う\",\n        \"フィールドcold\/warmはキャッシュ同等性を意味しない。暗号化の一律倍率を結論にしない\",\n        \"有限ラボで実施不能な本番条件は未計測と適用制限を明記し、無意味な追加実験を要求しない\"\n      ],\n      \"currentEvidence\": [\n        \"Interrupted white-all attempt2 actually used Ruby4.0.9, passed10self-checks, verified generated data\/replica, completed58shapes,99lock cases,36impact experiments and5matrix versions. It was deliberately stopped during01a because new high2\/middle1 protocol defects require source changes. Exit130 is intentional, not a Ruby\/bootstrap or DB failure. This is NOT final reproduction.\",\n        \"Read results\/reviews\/white-all-interruption.json and the immutable results\/reference\/review-20261107T053954Z-72116\/manifest.json. 01a is partial; later requested scripts were not run in this attempt. The source stayed unchanged during attempt2; no final proof exists.\",\n        \"Read the new results\/reviews\/sol-protocol-review.json and owner assessment. The findings are static counterexamples, not an assertion that current-run reqmix hit2013. Repair classification, necessary repetition budgeting and cleanup; preserve hypotheses.\",\n        \"All5pinned images are now downloaded. Docker VM filled during image pulls. Root removed only confirmed unused build caches; VM now has2.6GiB free, host142GiB. No images, containers, volumes or DB data were deleted for space. Read build-cache-cleanup-evidence.json; prepare images\/check space before performance in future.\",\n        \"The original31finding register and five focused Sol reviews remain pending final closure. Original Opus records are historical only; all new agents must be GPT-6.1 Sol.\",\n        \"Keep prior runtime selection, lossless8MiB raw chunks, artifact\/cache hashes, fresh-summary attribution, partitioned scale30scripts and tolerance105static\/48service scope. The current requested glob has118scripts before this repair; derive final scope from source.\",\n        \"LATEST environment-only retry: source unchanged through completed integration revision19. See space-retry-evidence.json. Current VMfreeKiB=6710280. Prior preflight failure is NOT DB\/measurement failure; final all still required. Use current prepared image\/cache without further cleanup during measurements.\"\n      ],\n      \"currentRevision\": 19,\n      \"detailPaths\": [\n        \"docs\/table-count-evidence.md\",\n        \"docs\/probability-count.md\"\n      ],\n      \"environmentRetryEvidencePath\": \"results\/reviews\/space-retry-evidence.json\",\n      \"findingRegisterPath\": \"results\/reviews\/finding-register.json\",\n      \"fixes\": [\n        {\n          \"boundedRemediation\": \"既存結果にerror_2013等が残っていれば、所有者監査で失敗・原因不明へ再分類するための再測定は不要。タイマーの裏付けが保存されていない1317を確定した予定上限へ昇格させない。欠けた有効比較を主張する場合だけ、その比較を補測する。\",\n          \"evidence\": \"results\/reviews\/sol-protocol-review.json\",\n          \"id\": \"SOL-PROTOCOL-001\",\n          \"requiredCorrection\": \"完了、確認済みの予定上限、予期しない失敗、原因不明、未着手を明示的に分類する。2013・接続断・計画拒否等はceiling hitに加算せず、保存後にsemantic failureへ反映する。1317は経過時間だけでタイマー扱いせず、既存split_countと同様にタイマーカウンタ等の裏付けを要求する。scale側の2013拒否は維持する。\",\n          \"severity\": \"high\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"boundedRemediation\": \"確認済み上限2回だけなら「その2観測で未完了」と限定でき、完走順位を主張しなければ追加反復は不要。速いarmの中央値・順位を必要とする場合だけ不足比較を補測する。scaleの300秒statement・150秒split上限を短縮して穴埋めしてはならない。\",\n          \"evidence\": \"results\/reviews\/sol-protocol-review.json\",\n          \"id\": \"SOL-PROTOCOL-002\",\n          \"requiredCorrection\": \"各条件・arm・反復機会を事前に列挙し、実行済み、確認済み打切り、規定による省略、予算不足、失敗をすべて記録する。必要反復と比較成立条件を別に判定し、不足はsemantic incompleteにする。必要な方式群・反復を分割する等で、先行armが後続比較の予算を消費し尽くさない設計にする。\",\n          \"severity\": \"high\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"boundedRemediation\": \"既存証拠で終了が確認できない窓は、後始末未確認・比較不能と分類できる。quiet truthやdrift境界の主張を撤回すれば、そのためだけの再測定は不要。中断後の影響やdriftを結論に必要とする場合だけ、該当経路を補測する。\",\n          \"evidence\": \"results\/reviews\/sol-protocol-review.json\",\n          \"id\": \"SOL-PROTOCOL-003\",\n          \"requiredCorrection\": \"中断時は所有する接続IDについて別接続から処理終了を確認し、必要なKILL・rollback・closeとその成否を保存する。確認できなければ次の比較を開始せず、後続結果を比較不能にする。負荷停止はfinallyで実施し、quiet truthを使う場合は未完了writeの解決とDB処理終了を別途確認する。意図した打切り観測にCOUNT全件完走を要求する必要はない。\",\n          \"severity\": \"middle\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"evidence\": \"results\/reviews\/build-cache-cleanup-evidence.json\",\n          \"id\": \"ROOT-VM-CAPACITY-MAINTENANCE\",\n          \"requiredCorrection\": \"ActualVMrootfilledduringmatriximagepullsafterbaselinephase. Rootalreadyreclaimedunusedbuildcacheonly;VMnow2.6GiBfreeandall5pinnedimagespulled. KeepDBdataonhostbindmounts. Make imagepreparation\/VMspacepreflight occur beforebenchmarkperformance sofuturewhiteallfailsbeforemeasurementifspaceunavailable. Do not perform automatic cache\/image\/container\/volume pruning. Document measuredlabresource requirements and no cache-controlled claim. No extra DB experiments outside fixedrunner.\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"frontierDesignReview\": {\n        \"assessmentPath\": \"results\/reviews\/sol-frontier-assessment.json\",\n        \"log\": \"results\/reviews\/sol-frontier-run.log\",\n        \"resultPath\": \"results\/reviews\/sol-frontier-review.json\",\n        \"snapshot\": \"results\/reference\/20261107-frontier-design\",\n        \"status\": \"completed,rejected middle3\/low1 on immutable pre-fix design\",\n        \"workflow\": \"temp-table-count-frontier-sol\"\n      },\n      \"guidelinePath\": \"docs\/table-count-guideline.md\",\n      \"historicalCurrentEvidence\": [\n        \"91修正版は3版で実行成功。ただし暗号化なし\/ありのBP再読込量が違い、暗号処理倍率の因果比較は未成立。新コードの操作ラベルはafter_evict\/immediate_repeat。master-key rotationのserver-event重複確認も追加済み、最終allで再計測する。\",\n        \"92は64観測が揃うが旧起動元の終了コード不明。statusはok=false\/observations_complete=trueへ修正済み。最終allで正常終了を取り直す。\",\n        \"93初期化状態付き再試験と94replica全項目は正常終了。54表のANALYZE後NUM_ROWSはUninitializedで誤差集計から除外。メタ情報取得前の真値COUNTが状態を初期化する影響も検証設計として確認する。\",\n        \"0c遅延STOP復旧は正常終了。0d\/0g〜0lの元レビュー要求が未解決。現在の完了状態と必要性を原文から確認する。\",\n        \"96\/97は旧負荷生成器で48腕ずつ完了。新Workloadは未着手要求を保存し保存則を検査、dispatch\/client実行時間を分離。reqwideにactual statement区間・trial raw samples・global arrival accountingを追加、親CPU3\/負荷CPU2\/DB0,1へ分離済み。新コードの再試験が必要。\",\n        \"98は修正後に7 fixture×5seedの35腕で正常終了。target25\/precision-not-reached10。中程度欠番と密度偏りも含む。metadata→MDL取得→metadata再確認、query後\/rollback後の期限判定、accuracy\/budget\/cleanup分類を修正。直近のDecimal判定とpreflight二重確認はセルフチェック済みで最終all再試験待ち。\",\n        \"12のTimer対象固定・cancel\/join修正版が実DBで正常終了。数値exit_code=0、fingerprint\/成果物hash保存。成功キャッシュの実再利用も12\/98で確認済み。\",\n        \"P0 harness修正: 静的import依存グラフ、設定、immutable image digest、実image ID、成功終了コード、成果物hashでのみ再利用。失敗と旧入力は再実行。t_denseの検証はMAX(id)でなく本当のCOUNT(*)。allに5つのセルフチェックを追加。\",\n        \"全体のwhite allは未実行。resetはDB\/生成結果を消しreference\/reviewsだけ保持し、再利用はしない。元数値はresults\/reference\/20261107-observationsへ160 JSONとmanifest保存。最新samplingはresults\/reference\/20261107-fixed-samplingへcode\/exit\/statusと共に保存。\",\n        \"Root pre-final audit at results\/reviews\/pre-final-audit.json verifies historical hashes\/local links and flags that experiments.py main currently does not propagate result.errors into exit status; final white-all proof must inspect semantic errors and intentional cancellation separately, not just process exit.\",\n        \"Root confirmed historical 3e\/3f failed with OperationalError2013 on the superseded unbounded reqruns.write_mix_body design; reqmix.py explicitly documents its replacement but old wrappers still enter all. See ROOT-SUPERSEDED-UNBOUNDED-PROTOCOLS in completionAuditPath. Preserve old evidence and full write-mix hypothesis coverage, but fix or explicitly retire superseded invalid protocols before final all rather than accepting partial output.\",\n        \"Derived existing accuracy curves are in accuracyFrontierExistingEvidencePath, with source hashes. In this later58-fixture observation TABLE_ROWS expiry0 was57\/58 within10% beforeANALYZE and55\/58 afterANALYZE; do not overwrite the distinct initial corpus or call these production success probabilities. UUID sample-pages20\/200\/2000 had maxabs errors21.59\/8.211\/1.547%; uneven-row fixture20pages reached38.731%,200pages2.131%,2000pages2.812%. More sampling is not monotonic per run and ANALYZE is separate maintenance.\",\n        \"Existing checkpoint replay in accuracyFrontierExistingEvidencePath: uneven_density first recorded target bounds at3\/5\/10%=8192\/2048\/512 draws in all5seeds; moderate_gaps=2048\/512\/512; gaps\/islands never meet even10%. These use the same predeclared simultaneous bands, not new post-hoc looks, and lack checkpoint elapsed\/counter measurements. Do not infer runtimes or claim this replaces the new tolerance-cost experiment.\",\n        \"01a AND01b completed successfully with unchanged source and verified artifact hashes; immutable snapshot results\/reference\/20261107-wide-sampling. Each has20 static and36 service arms with consistent arrival accounting. Static no-index100-column COUNT6.8817-8.1966s vs sample0.7568-1.0313s; small-index COUNT0.0494-0.0723s vs sample1.1712-3.1946s. Under1s service budget,100-column sampling had6\/6 exhausted without small index and3\/6 exhausted with index. Do not call static speed an SLO pass.\",\n        \"Isolated3\/5\/10% comparison code has been prepared without changing running imports; see latestAccuracySteering. Syntax\/diff checks and pure band\/dependency checks pass; actual measurement is pending.\",\n        \"0d completed exit0,all sections present.0g completed exit0,all20arms\/five repeats\/windows present,no skipped arms or section errors. At10M rows,indexed-column updates310\/s,256MB pool, statement_k18.758-26.480s,statement_pk0.719-1.254s,split_pk2.307-2.405s. This counters any blanket small-secondary-index rule under MVCC\/write churn. Exact SQL forms\/settings and physical reads must be interpreted; do not attribute the whole difference solely to index size. Growing immutable-source snapshot at primaryCoverageSnapshotPath. Other0h-0l still running.\",\n        \"Root fixed a concrete new-frontier failure-loss path discovered during the read-only review: record_sample persists the sample before comparison, skips comparison on unexpected sample failure, and persists a comparison failure without losing the sample. Pure regression uses actual function AST and failed fake connections; results\/reviews\/accuracy-frontier-failure-regression.json passes. New bench\/test_accuracy_frontier.py should be added to lab.self_checks after current owner ends. The design-review immutable snapshot intentionally retains the pre-fix code; 